WEBVTT

01:44.000 --> 01:44.720
Alright.

01:45.800 --> 01:46.479
I'll figure something out.

01:49.880 --> 01:50.400
Give me a smile.

01:51.880 --> 01:52.640
I can't.

01:56.920 --> 01:58.200
I said I can't smile!

02:03.560 --> 02:04.880
Grandma, slow down.

02:09.759 --> 02:10.759
Seen Qing Ye?

02:12.040 --> 02:13.160
She went to the beach.

02:13.400 --> 02:15.120
Said she'd take a walk and be back soon.

02:21.160 --> 02:21.680
Grandma,

02:24.640 --> 02:26.240
do you really support

02:26.240 --> 02:26.880
me bringing Qing Ye back?

02:30.200 --> 02:32.079
I know you.

02:32.200 --> 02:34.200
You'd even take in

02:34.200 --> 02:35.920
a stray cat off the street,

02:36.040 --> 02:37.240
let alone a person.

02:39.200 --> 02:41.200
Rough on my grandson though.

02:43.840 --> 02:45.079
As long as you're all okay,

02:45.440 --> 02:46.320
I'm happy.

03:07.480 --> 03:08.040
What're you looking at?

03:11.280 --> 03:12.160
The Zhazhating.

03:13.680 --> 03:14.400
It feels…

03:15.880 --> 03:17.280
familiar and strange at the same time.

03:20.400 --> 03:21.360
Last time you left,

03:22.120 --> 03:23.160
you never planned to come back, right?

03:26.640 --> 03:28.320
I thought if I left,

03:29.040 --> 03:30.640
everything would go back to normal.

03:32.720 --> 03:33.520
But,

03:34.480 --> 03:35.040
that world

03:35.040 --> 03:35.920
doesn't belong to me anymore.

03:37.760 --> 03:38.960
So coming back this time

03:40.160 --> 03:41.440
really is my last resort.

03:43.560 --> 03:45.000
I thought I'd be scared

03:46.160 --> 03:46.760
and lost.

03:48.520 --> 03:49.800
But standing here,

03:50.520 --> 03:51.640
I actually feel lighter.

03:52.880 --> 03:54.640
Feels like my summer break

03:55.400 --> 03:56.320
is finally starting.

04:01.280 --> 04:02.160
Good attitude.

04:02.760 --> 04:03.320
Looks like

04:03.840 --> 04:05.040
you're doing a lot better.

04:14.600 --> 04:15.160
Xing Wu,

04:16.560 --> 04:17.200
thanks.

04:21.320 --> 04:21.959
For what?

04:24.280 --> 04:25.000
For giving me

04:25.000 --> 04:26.360
a fresh start.

04:31.760 --> 04:32.280
No big deal.

04:35.920 --> 04:36.760
You seen that?

04:42.600 --> 04:43.440
A hermit crab.

04:44.680 --> 04:45.200
That's right.

04:46.080 --> 04:47.240
As they grow,

04:47.360 --> 04:48.320
hermit crabs

04:48.920 --> 04:49.960
keep changing shells.

04:51.560 --> 04:52.280
Basically…

04:54.400 --> 04:55.800
moving into new homes.

04:58.920 --> 05:00.280
Every time they leave an old shell behind,

05:00.760 --> 05:02.040
they're at their weakest.

05:14.560 --> 05:15.800
But as they adapt

05:15.800 --> 05:16.640
to a new shell,

05:17.240 --> 05:18.840
they grow tougher

05:18.840 --> 05:20.640
and stronger.

05:28.040 --> 05:28.800
People are the same.

05:33.200 --> 05:34.720
Did auntie say I can stay?

05:36.480 --> 05:37.640
She took your gift,

05:37.960 --> 05:39.159
can't exactly kick you out now.

05:40.159 --> 05:40.880
That's great.

05:41.920 --> 05:42.480
I thought

05:42.480 --> 05:43.720
I'd end up homeless again.

05:45.440 --> 05:46.080
No way.

05:47.680 --> 05:48.440
You've got me!

05:49.920 --> 05:51.440
Hope this year on Xuan Island,

05:53.520 --> 05:55.200
you'll grow tougher

05:55.840 --> 05:56.400
and stronger, too.

06:07.840 --> 06:08.520
I will.

06:21.880 --> 06:22.360
Lanfang.

06:22.920 --> 06:23.480
You're back.

06:23.640 --> 06:24.120
Here's your invoice.

06:24.120 --> 06:24.800
Okay, come on in.

06:25.400 --> 06:26.080
Careful.

06:26.160 --> 06:26.520
Okay.

06:34.640 --> 06:35.560
58.

06:44.880 --> 06:46.159
That's a lot.

06:46.880 --> 06:48.159
And I still owe money.

06:48.800 --> 06:50.280
Lanfang, gas tank's changed.

06:50.400 --> 06:50.840
Great.

06:51.000 --> 06:52.320
I'll transfer the money to you later.

06:52.480 --> 06:52.800
Alright.

06:56.040 --> 06:56.880
You're here.

06:57.200 --> 06:57.760
Mrs. Liu.

06:58.560 --> 06:59.400
Come, sit.

07:00.280 --> 07:01.960
What style today?

07:03.200 --> 07:04.000
I sent it over,

07:04.200 --> 07:04.760
Liu Nian.

07:05.160 --> 07:05.560
Okay.

07:40.040 --> 07:41.159
Your hair…

07:43.200 --> 07:44.240
Thinking of a new look.

07:46.480 --> 07:46.880
Oh, right.

07:47.560 --> 07:48.640
From now on,

07:49.200 --> 07:50.159
this room's yours.

07:51.560 --> 07:52.240
Then where'll you stay?

07:52.920 --> 07:53.840
The storage room downstairs.

07:54.200 --> 07:55.200
Can people actually live there?

07:55.440 --> 07:55.960
Sure.

07:57.000 --> 07:58.920
I usually crash at Shunyi anyway.

07:59.640 --> 08:00.520
Just need a bed.

08:02.880 --> 08:03.560
Thanks.

08:05.720 --> 08:06.600
Enough.

08:06.600 --> 08:07.880
You've said thanks all day.

08:15.240 --> 08:16.040
Wait a sec.

08:22.160 --> 08:22.680
This is for you.

08:24.920 --> 08:26.240
I don't need this.

08:27.320 --> 08:28.600
Of course you need it.

08:29.080 --> 08:30.600
You're always hunched over

08:30.600 --> 08:31.600
fixing phones.

08:32.000 --> 08:33.039
It's bad for your neck.

08:34.640 --> 08:35.120
Put it on.

08:39.080 --> 08:39.520
Fine.

08:40.559 --> 08:41.640
I'll wear it.

08:44.560 --> 08:45.400
I know

08:46.520 --> 08:47.680
I'm gonna be a burden

08:47.720 --> 08:48.920
on your family.

08:49.920 --> 08:51.600
So I'll do whatever I can

08:51.960 --> 08:52.800
to help out more.

08:53.920 --> 08:54.800
I'll keep track

08:54.800 --> 08:55.960
of every expense.

08:56.320 --> 08:57.680
When I start making money,

08:58.160 --> 08:59.520
I'll pay you back with interest.

09:02.160 --> 09:02.600
Deal.

09:03.480 --> 09:04.000
I'll wait for you

09:04.760 --> 09:05.320
to grow up

09:05.960 --> 09:06.480
and show your filial respect.

09:07.800 --> 09:08.960
What filial?

09:09.240 --> 09:10.280
Don't push your luck!

09:14.400 --> 09:14.920
Ye,

09:16.160 --> 09:17.600
stop treating yourself like a burden.

09:19.880 --> 09:21.160
You don't have to walk on eggshells

09:21.520 --> 09:22.240
or read people's moods.

09:22.640 --> 09:24.040
And stop thinking you owe us

09:24.040 --> 09:24.600
something.

09:26.160 --> 09:27.080
We see you as family.

09:29.200 --> 09:29.920
Hope you see us that way too.

09:37.320 --> 09:37.800
Good night.

10:54.200 --> 10:54.920
[Mom,]

10:55.840 --> 10:57.440
[this place looks the same.]

10:58.680 --> 11:00.040
[But somehow everything's changed.]

11:35.360 --> 11:37.320
[Fruit! Fresh fruit!]

11:38.000 --> 11:39.800
[Fresh fruit here!]

11:40.560 --> 11:42.640
[Fresh fruit!]

11:43.400 --> 11:44.880
[Fruit!]

11:44.880 --> 11:47.800
Fresh tofu!

11:48.120 --> 11:49.680
Fresh fruit!

11:49.760 --> 11:52.520
Fresh-made tofu!

11:54.800 --> 11:57.520
[Fresh tofu!]

12:02.840 --> 12:03.960
[Qing Ye, where are you?]

12:03.960 --> 12:04.840
[I'm really worried.]

12:05.640 --> 12:06.880
[Don't take my mom's words to heart.]

12:06.920 --> 12:08.000
[She didn't mean it like that.]

12:08.640 --> 12:09.080
[You've got me.]

12:09.080 --> 12:10.480
[Stay at my place, no worries.]

12:10.600 --> 12:11.880
[Stay as long as you want.]

12:12.280 --> 12:13.600
[I meant what I said.]

12:14.360 --> 12:16.360
[Qing Ye, don't ignore me.]

12:17.520 --> 12:18.880
[I came back to Zhazhating.]

12:19.600 --> 12:20.480
[Zhazhating?]

12:20.880 --> 12:22.200
[Didn't you hate that place?]

12:25.040 --> 12:26.200
[Not anymore.]

12:35.600 --> 12:38.840
[Alipay received: 80 yuan.]

12:39.160 --> 12:39.880
Lanfang,

12:40.080 --> 12:40.800
didn't we agree

12:40.800 --> 12:41.640
on 85 minimum?

12:41.800 --> 12:43.240
You even cut off the extra change?

12:43.800 --> 12:45.160
It was just some conchs,

12:45.160 --> 12:46.400
scallops, and clams.

12:46.400 --> 12:47.480
80's fine.

12:47.600 --> 12:48.640
Making a living ain't easy.

12:48.640 --> 12:49.560
We're up before dawn, back after dark…

12:49.560 --> 12:51.160
It's only five yuan, let it go.

12:51.160 --> 12:51.840
Yeah, Yu.

12:51.840 --> 12:53.400
- Yeah.
- We're neighbors.

12:53.480 --> 12:53.960
We are regulars.

12:53.960 --> 12:55.640
We'll buy from you again next time.

12:55.640 --> 12:57.000
Alright then. Come again.

12:57.080 --> 12:57.840
Thanks.

12:57.840 --> 12:58.600
Thanks, Yu.

12:58.600 --> 12:59.680
We'll be back.

13:00.000 --> 13:01.760
You sure splurged, bought quite a lot!

13:02.680 --> 13:04.160
Acting all high and mighty,

13:04.320 --> 13:06.040
saying you didn't want her around.

13:08.000 --> 13:09.560
You're even wearing the scarf now.

13:10.040 --> 13:10.760
You actually put it on.

13:10.840 --> 13:12.080
- Looks great.
- Looks good.

13:12.200 --> 13:13.320
Must've cost a lot.

13:13.840 --> 13:15.280
Hard to say no

13:15.360 --> 13:16.920
after taking her gift, right?

13:17.600 --> 13:19.320
That's not why.

13:19.720 --> 13:21.280
Sure, we're not well-off,

13:21.280 --> 13:23.000
but raising a kid ain't raising fish,

13:23.000 --> 13:24.560
you gotta be responsible.

13:24.960 --> 13:26.280
That girl's got

13:26.280 --> 13:27.440
a bright future ahead.

13:27.720 --> 13:29.040
What if she gets stuck here?

13:29.040 --> 13:30.400
How am I supposed to face my sister?

13:31.080 --> 13:32.160
That's true.

13:32.440 --> 13:33.840
After all she's someone else's kid,

13:34.400 --> 13:36.160
you can't scold her or lay a hand on her.

13:36.400 --> 13:37.720
And if you're even slightly unhappy,

13:37.720 --> 13:38.920
you're worried she'll get upset

13:39.080 --> 13:40.000
- or feel wronged.
- Exactly.

13:40.080 --> 13:41.160
Yeah.

13:41.160 --> 13:41.800
Besides,

13:41.840 --> 13:43.280
I've never raised a daughter before.

13:44.640 --> 13:45.440
Never raised a daughter?

13:45.440 --> 13:47.000
But you've been a girl yourself.

13:47.160 --> 13:48.160
We've all been 17 or 18 before,

13:48.160 --> 13:49.600
haven't we?

13:49.680 --> 13:50.760
Just copy the pattern

13:50.760 --> 13:51.880
and treat her like she's your own.

13:52.240 --> 13:53.400
What's the problem with that?

13:53.680 --> 13:54.920
Like my own?

13:55.040 --> 13:55.920
Oh come on!

13:56.040 --> 13:57.520
When I was 17 or 18,

13:57.520 --> 13:59.000
my life was a total mess!

13:59.360 --> 14:00.720
There's no way

14:00.720 --> 14:02.160
I'd let Qing Ye end up like me.

14:04.800 --> 14:05.680
And you still say

14:05.680 --> 14:06.960
that I'm generous with money?

14:07.240 --> 14:08.800
You, "Cici".

14:08.800 --> 14:09.400
I didn't.

14:10.160 --> 14:10.920
When you bought oysters

14:10.920 --> 14:11.800
for Big G's dad,

14:11.840 --> 14:13.000
you were way more generous than me.

14:14.160 --> 14:15.520
How much did you buy today?

14:15.600 --> 14:16.920
Not much.

14:17.440 --> 14:18.160
Cici!

14:18.280 --> 14:19.480
You didn't buy much today,

14:19.640 --> 14:20.880
how about we go with you again

14:20.880 --> 14:22.320
and pick up some sand onions,
sea cucumber,

14:22.440 --> 14:23.600
and deer antler wine?

14:23.800 --> 14:24.880
Keep it down!

14:24.920 --> 14:25.960
So many people around,

14:25.960 --> 14:26.520
aren't you embarrassed?

14:27.680 --> 14:28.760
Sea cucumber's over there!

14:28.800 --> 14:29.880
Deer antler wine's over there too!

14:29.880 --> 14:30.520
Look at her!

14:35.360 --> 14:35.840
Bo.

14:36.720 --> 14:37.480
Your phone's fixed.

14:37.760 --> 14:38.440
Let me see.

14:41.640 --> 14:43.000
Nice, impressive.

14:43.520 --> 14:44.400
How much?

14:45.240 --> 14:46.160
It's fine, no need.

14:46.440 --> 14:47.080
No.

14:47.360 --> 14:48.360
I'll transfer you.

14:49.720 --> 14:50.680
Thanks, Bo, I'm off.

14:50.720 --> 14:51.160
Bye.

14:52.920 --> 14:54.040
Round off the change.

14:54.680 --> 14:55.720
430 is fine.

14:55.960 --> 14:56.400
Alright,

14:57.280 --> 14:57.920
sent on WeChat.

14:58.640 --> 14:59.160
Okay.

15:07.600 --> 15:08.560
Sir, it's paid.

15:08.960 --> 15:09.400
Alright.

15:12.800 --> 15:13.280
Bo.

15:13.600 --> 15:13.920
Ye.

15:13.920 --> 15:14.440
A bottle of water.

15:14.560 --> 15:15.320
Sure, over here.

15:18.920 --> 15:19.720
Same time as usual today.

15:20.160 --> 15:21.160
Go and you'll get paid.

15:22.640 --> 15:23.240
I've already taken

15:23.240 --> 15:24.240
several days off.

15:24.400 --> 15:25.560
People are unhappy about it.

15:26.320 --> 15:27.240
I really can't go anymore.

15:29.600 --> 15:30.600
That crappy little barbershop of yours?

15:31.000 --> 15:32.320
How much can you even make a day?

15:32.960 --> 15:34.360
Come with me to the city karaoke club

15:34.560 --> 15:36.600
and you can make hundreds a day.

15:36.840 --> 15:38.160
I'm not quitting.

15:38.240 --> 15:39.960
Working with Lanfang

15:40.440 --> 15:40.920
is fine.

15:41.640 --> 15:42.200
Fine?

15:42.680 --> 15:43.640
You can't even make ends meet,

15:43.640 --> 15:44.760
what's so great about that?

15:46.560 --> 15:47.480
You don't understand.

15:48.400 --> 15:49.920
Lanfang's family is struggling right now,

15:50.280 --> 15:51.160
I can't leave.

15:53.760 --> 15:54.880
Alright, can't talk you out of it.

15:57.680 --> 15:59.520
Here's yesterday's money.

16:00.160 --> 16:01.920
Call me anytime if you change your mind.

16:22.800 --> 16:23.840
Hey, don't get me wrong.

16:24.600 --> 16:25.840
I'm not planning to switch jobs.

16:26.440 --> 16:27.280
I just think

16:27.480 --> 16:28.680
your friend has a point.

16:29.560 --> 16:30.600
The city karaoke club

16:31.160 --> 16:32.200
definitely pays more than Xuan Island.

16:32.920 --> 16:34.400
No matter how much, I'm not leaving.

16:35.480 --> 16:36.440
I stay at Xuan Island

16:36.720 --> 16:37.600
to repay a favor.

16:40.160 --> 16:40.640
A favor?

16:41.080 --> 16:42.560
Lanfang saved my life.

16:47.200 --> 16:48.080
Six years ago,

16:48.840 --> 16:50.600
if not for Lanfang and Wu,

16:51.960 --> 16:52.600
I'd probably

16:52.600 --> 16:53.320
be out on the streets begging.

16:54.840 --> 16:56.160
[After my parents split up,]

16:56.440 --> 16:57.600
[they both started new families.]

16:58.880 --> 17:00.160
[My grandma was old,]

17:00.600 --> 17:01.400
[and she was my only support.]

17:02.800 --> 17:03.640
[We were dirt poor.]

17:03.720 --> 17:05.400
[I was malnourished as a kid,]

17:05.720 --> 17:07.200
[so I stayed skinny]

17:07.960 --> 17:09.000
[and got picked on all the time.]

17:10.680 --> 17:11.920
[Back in vocational school,]

17:11.920 --> 17:12.880
[some punks]

17:12.880 --> 17:13.599
[kept messing with me.]

17:13.880 --> 17:15.000
What junk did you pick up?

17:15.160 --> 17:15.760
Come on, let us see.

17:16.000 --> 17:16.480
What are you doing?

17:17.040 --> 17:17.839
You stinky beggar!

17:18.839 --> 17:20.280
I… I'm not a beggar!

17:20.440 --> 17:21.800
Say that again and I'll beat you up!

17:23.000 --> 17:23.720
Hey, what's going on?

17:24.680 --> 17:25.839
Drop it and scram!

17:38.200 --> 17:38.720
You okay?

17:41.680 --> 17:42.160
I'm fine.

17:42.920 --> 17:43.680
[It was Wu]

17:44.520 --> 17:45.640
[who brought me into Xuan Island.]

17:59.920 --> 18:01.040
That's already his third bowl.

18:01.920 --> 18:02.440
Wu,

18:02.800 --> 18:03.960
go to Bo's again

18:03.960 --> 18:04.680
and grab two more buckets.

18:05.560 --> 18:05.880
Okay.

18:05.880 --> 18:07.080
No need!

18:07.880 --> 18:08.600
I'm full.

18:09.480 --> 18:10.440
Then slow down.

18:10.440 --> 18:11.360
Don't rush.

18:16.560 --> 18:17.880
How old are you?

18:19.160 --> 18:19.680
18.

18:21.480 --> 18:23.160
Older than Wu.

18:24.880 --> 18:26.240
Anyone else at home?

18:27.800 --> 18:28.360
At home…

18:29.600 --> 18:30.440
only my grandma's left.

18:42.320 --> 18:42.760
Done.

18:43.720 --> 18:44.280
Take a look.

18:44.640 --> 18:45.360
Nice and clean.

18:46.240 --> 18:46.880
Thanks, ma'am.

18:55.960 --> 18:56.840
What happened next?

18:57.920 --> 18:58.560
Later,

18:59.440 --> 19:01.440
Lanfang had me help out

19:01.800 --> 19:02.680
and sweep floors at the shop

19:02.840 --> 19:03.440
after school.

19:03.880 --> 19:04.960
Seeing I could stick it out,

19:05.440 --> 19:06.640
she kept me on

19:06.720 --> 19:07.360
after graduation

19:07.720 --> 19:08.520
as her apprentice.

19:09.040 --> 19:10.160
I said yes right away.

19:12.240 --> 19:12.720
Look.

19:14.440 --> 19:15.840
That lone seagull

19:16.200 --> 19:16.800
is like me.

19:18.040 --> 19:18.720
Xuan Island

19:19.400 --> 19:20.560
is the nest that took me in.

19:21.760 --> 19:22.760
And Lanfang and Wu

19:23.200 --> 19:24.000
are my saviors.

19:25.480 --> 19:26.480
Hearing this,

19:28.400 --> 19:31.240
I feel… we're kinda alike.

19:32.760 --> 19:33.920
How could I be like you?

19:34.960 --> 19:35.480
You grew up

19:35.480 --> 19:36.600
well off, for sure.

19:37.480 --> 19:38.040
You don't get it.

19:38.640 --> 19:39.920
It's like when you're starving,

19:40.160 --> 19:41.080
and someone hands you a bowl

19:41.080 --> 19:41.840
of instant noodles.

19:42.840 --> 19:43.360
Or,

19:43.680 --> 19:44.480
like swimming in the sea

19:45.080 --> 19:45.920
and drowning,

19:46.240 --> 19:47.640
and someone throws you a lifebuoy.

19:48.560 --> 19:49.040
I get it.

19:50.080 --> 19:51.080
It's like

19:51.920 --> 19:53.520
you're swimming for your life,

19:54.240 --> 19:55.520
but can't reach shore.

19:56.800 --> 19:57.520
Just when you're about

19:57.520 --> 19:58.720
to give up,

20:00.560 --> 20:01.760
someone shows up,

20:02.920 --> 20:04.080
pulls you back hard,

20:05.120 --> 20:06.360
and brings you back to life.

20:08.520 --> 20:09.520
[You've been through that too?]

20:14.240 --> 20:14.840
Xuan Island

20:15.160 --> 20:16.400
is more than just a workplace,

20:17.560 --> 20:18.320
it feels

20:18.800 --> 20:19.440
more like a home.

20:26.520 --> 20:28.040
About what just happened,

20:28.560 --> 20:29.520
can you keep it to yourself?

20:31.040 --> 20:31.600
Don't worry,

20:32.160 --> 20:33.360
my memory's like a goldfish.

20:34.440 --> 20:35.480
What did you just say?

20:37.400 --> 20:37.880
Let's go.

20:38.040 --> 20:38.960
Or you'll be late.

20:47.400 --> 20:47.840
Qing Ye.

20:48.640 --> 20:49.320
Don't go in yet.

20:50.440 --> 20:51.000
What's up?

20:52.640 --> 20:53.400
The debt guys are here.

20:54.240 --> 20:55.000
Don't go in yet.

20:55.400 --> 20:56.000
I'll check it out.

21:01.560 --> 21:02.160
Ma,

21:02.600 --> 21:03.800
what brings you here at this hour?

21:03.960 --> 21:04.600
Have some tea.

21:04.840 --> 21:05.440
It's good.

21:06.160 --> 21:07.240
Skip the tea.

21:07.840 --> 21:08.760
Wu, where's your mom?

21:09.040 --> 21:10.160
She's not here.

21:10.920 --> 21:11.320
Fine.

21:11.600 --> 21:12.880
Then I'll wait.

21:18.880 --> 21:19.360
How about this?

21:19.560 --> 21:20.560
Don't just sit around.

21:20.760 --> 21:22.040
I'll have Liu Nian give you a trim,

21:22.080 --> 21:22.760
kill time while you wait.

21:23.000 --> 21:23.800
Liu Nian, come.

21:24.160 --> 21:24.880
Give Ma a trim.

21:24.880 --> 21:25.800
Sure, coming.

21:25.960 --> 21:26.520
I got this.

21:27.680 --> 21:29.520
Look at my hair, need a cut?

21:32.000 --> 21:32.560
Then,

21:32.920 --> 21:33.800
how about a wash?

21:34.200 --> 21:35.320
Already washed up.

21:35.680 --> 21:36.160
No need.

21:36.560 --> 21:37.560
Come on, Ma.

21:37.800 --> 21:38.960
Next time just come here.

21:39.040 --> 21:40.680
Wash and cut, on the house.

21:42.880 --> 21:44.400
Nothing free

21:44.480 --> 21:45.440
lasts forever.

21:45.800 --> 21:46.960
Sooner or later, you pay up.

21:47.440 --> 21:48.000
Wu,

21:48.320 --> 21:49.400
tell me, am I wrong?

22:09.560 --> 22:10.440
Wait, Wu,

22:11.080 --> 22:12.760
you missed a zero.

22:18.200 --> 22:19.080
I'll pay back the rest

22:20.080 --> 22:20.760
little by little.

22:21.480 --> 22:22.400
Your mom said different

22:22.400 --> 22:23.680
last month.

22:24.280 --> 22:26.160
She said once some "money god" left,

22:26.280 --> 22:27.840
she'd wire us another 20 grand.

22:30.600 --> 22:31.840
I'm really short on cash.

22:32.080 --> 22:32.720
Could you

22:33.560 --> 22:34.400
cut me some slack?

22:35.400 --> 22:35.920
Well,

22:36.320 --> 22:37.960
give me another 2,700,

22:38.480 --> 22:39.560
round it off.

22:40.280 --> 22:41.560
Makes my job easier.

22:41.840 --> 22:42.400
Sir,

22:42.760 --> 22:44.440
Wu's cleaned out his account.

22:44.600 --> 22:45.200
All of Xuan Island

22:45.200 --> 22:46.000
has barely a hundred left.

22:46.000 --> 22:47.240
What're we supposed to pay with?

22:48.560 --> 22:50.040
Ma, give us two more days.

22:50.040 --> 22:50.640
Just two.

22:50.640 --> 22:51.640
I'll bring you the money

22:51.640 --> 22:52.440
in two days.

22:52.760 --> 22:54.720
How you pay me

22:55.160 --> 22:56.960
is your problem.

22:57.760 --> 22:59.200
Not my circus!

23:00.880 --> 23:01.440
Wu,

23:01.600 --> 23:02.760
I'm not busting your chops.

23:03.040 --> 23:04.280
I work for a living too.

23:04.680 --> 23:06.440
If I don't get the money today,

23:09.160 --> 23:10.200
I'll stay here

23:10.200 --> 23:11.160
as long as it takes.

23:19.840 --> 23:20.560
I'll pay.

23:22.680 --> 23:24.280
Not your mess. Stay out of it.

23:26.680 --> 23:28.000
Pull up your QR code.

23:38.480 --> 23:38.880
Alright.

23:40.400 --> 23:41.000
Wu,

23:41.320 --> 23:42.320
having a rich friend

23:42.320 --> 23:43.120
sure comes in handy.

23:43.480 --> 23:45.160
Pay off the rest, fast.

23:45.520 --> 23:47.480
If someone else comes next time,

23:47.680 --> 23:48.520
they won't be

23:48.520 --> 23:49.680
this easygoing.

23:56.160 --> 23:57.160
Where'd you get the money?

23:57.800 --> 23:59.480
You fixed my computer last time

23:59.480 --> 24:00.360
and charged me nothing.

24:00.800 --> 24:01.760
Call us even.

24:03.040 --> 24:04.360
You paid my debt,

24:04.640 --> 24:05.280
what about you?

24:05.560 --> 24:06.520
Live on air?

24:07.680 --> 24:08.320
You wouldn't

24:08.320 --> 24:09.480
let me starve anyway.

24:10.200 --> 24:10.720
Fair point.

24:11.960 --> 24:13.360
Money comes, money goes.

24:13.600 --> 24:14.760
We've still got Xuan Island.

24:18.640 --> 24:20.720
58 plus 30 plus 30

24:20.720 --> 24:21.560
plus four tens.

24:21.760 --> 24:22.920
Hang on.

24:23.000 --> 24:24.480
28 plus 30…

24:24.480 --> 24:25.240
58.

24:26.640 --> 24:27.960
Plus 58.

24:28.040 --> 24:29.640
It's 58 plus 30.

24:31.600 --> 24:32.800
3659.

24:33.040 --> 24:34.280
3659.

24:36.520 --> 24:37.040
Correct?

24:37.400 --> 24:38.320
Forget the math.

24:39.320 --> 24:39.760
Correct.

24:40.880 --> 24:41.400
Qing Ye,

24:41.640 --> 24:43.320
you were doing it in your head?

24:43.800 --> 24:45.360
It's not that hard to calculate.

24:46.000 --> 24:46.520
Wu,

24:47.000 --> 24:48.200
you've got someone to keep

24:48.200 --> 24:49.480
Auntie Lanfang's books straight now.

24:49.720 --> 24:50.680
"Modern-day female strategist",

24:50.880 --> 24:51.560
Qing Ye.

24:52.920 --> 24:53.720
I just don't get

24:53.720 --> 24:55.480
how you're doing your books here.

24:56.000 --> 24:57.160
The numbers don't quite add up.

24:57.400 --> 24:58.160
What's wrong?

24:59.960 --> 25:01.960
I came on the 10th this month.

25:02.400 --> 25:03.720
So up to the end of the month,

25:03.720 --> 25:04.560
that's 21 days.

25:04.800 --> 25:06.920
Net income is 3,150.

25:07.160 --> 25:07.960
So that's

25:07.960 --> 25:08.880
150 a day on average.

25:08.920 --> 25:11.160
Plus the 4,650

25:11.360 --> 25:12.480
from before I came.

25:13.040 --> 25:14.200
Then last July,

25:14.280 --> 25:15.600
start of summer break,

25:15.800 --> 25:17.280
should've been peak season.

25:17.440 --> 25:18.200
So actual income

25:18.200 --> 25:19.800
should be above average.

25:19.800 --> 25:21.640
Let's say over 5,000.

25:21.960 --> 25:24.000
Then Liu Nian's salary,

25:24.040 --> 25:25.400
plus utilities

25:25.480 --> 25:27.000
and all the little expenses,

25:27.240 --> 25:28.200
that's 3,600.

25:28.560 --> 25:29.480
So last month's net profit

25:29.480 --> 25:30.640
should still be over 1,000.

25:30.680 --> 25:32.240
No way there's nothing left now.

25:35.040 --> 25:36.040
Is that right?

25:37.080 --> 25:37.920
Seems like it.

25:38.080 --> 25:39.240
It was the start of summer break,

25:39.600 --> 25:40.400
lots of students came in.

25:42.040 --> 25:42.720
And think about it.

25:43.080 --> 25:44.160
Over the past few months,

25:44.760 --> 25:45.880
Liu Nian's salary

25:46.080 --> 25:46.800
and all these

25:46.800 --> 25:48.200
extra expenses,

25:48.400 --> 25:49.760
you didn't run through
Xuan Island's books,

25:50.080 --> 25:51.360
you paid out of your own pocket.

25:52.920 --> 25:53.880
So…

25:54.520 --> 25:55.040
where's the money?

25:56.640 --> 25:57.760
So, where's the money?

26:01.160 --> 26:02.480
I'm back.

26:04.720 --> 26:05.720
Everyone here.

26:05.800 --> 26:06.240
Great.

26:06.440 --> 26:07.760
I bought some seafood.

26:07.800 --> 26:08.760
We'll eat together later.

26:12.560 --> 26:13.160
What's going on?

26:17.160 --> 26:18.560
The debt collector just came.

26:18.920 --> 26:20.560
Qing Ye paid 2,700 yuan

26:20.560 --> 26:21.520
to send them off.

26:22.160 --> 26:23.160
Now Xuan Island doesn't even

26:23.160 --> 26:24.160
have 200 left. So…

26:24.360 --> 26:25.880
Where did the money go?

26:35.280 --> 26:35.880
What?

26:36.360 --> 26:37.520
So I'm the one who spent

26:37.520 --> 26:38.360
all the shop's money?

26:39.360 --> 26:40.160
Hello, Mom?

26:40.840 --> 26:43.240
Uh… want me back for dinner, right?

26:43.480 --> 26:44.480
I'm off, Auntie Lanfang.

26:44.520 --> 26:45.560
My mom asked me this morning

26:45.560 --> 26:46.160
to help serve dishes.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.000
I should still make it.

26:47.000 --> 26:47.440
Bye.

27:00.000 --> 27:01.600
I've been running this place

27:01.600 --> 27:02.720
day in, day out.

27:03.320 --> 27:04.240
Taking care of the old

27:04.240 --> 27:05.600
and the young.

27:06.040 --> 27:07.560
I don't even have any other hobbies

27:07.680 --> 27:09.160
besides buying a few things now and then.

27:09.960 --> 27:10.560
What now?

27:11.160 --> 27:12.720
You're auditing me?

27:12.960 --> 27:14.160
So it's all my fault, right?

27:14.880 --> 27:15.600
No.

27:15.680 --> 27:16.600
Auntie.

27:16.960 --> 27:18.280
Buying things isn't a problem.

27:18.320 --> 27:19.560
Everyone's got a hobby.

27:19.960 --> 27:21.520
That's just paying for happiness.

27:21.640 --> 27:23.400
Life's all about being happy,

27:24.200 --> 27:24.640
right?

27:24.920 --> 27:25.760
Right!

27:25.840 --> 27:27.720
That's exactly it!

27:28.480 --> 27:29.760
It's just that today

27:30.320 --> 27:31.800
after checking the accounts, we found out

27:32.080 --> 27:34.240
Xuan Island is profitable.

27:35.080 --> 27:35.680
We thought

27:35.680 --> 27:36.760
it wasn't making money anymore.

27:37.000 --> 27:37.800
Not only is it profitable,

27:38.040 --> 27:39.280
the profit alone

27:39.440 --> 27:40.720
is more than enough to cover

27:40.760 --> 27:41.760
the whole family's expenses.

27:42.720 --> 27:43.240
See?

27:43.680 --> 27:44.600
Not everyone

27:44.960 --> 27:45.960
can pull off

27:45.960 --> 27:47.520
a business like this, Auntie.

27:47.680 --> 27:48.320
Maybe even my dad

27:48.320 --> 27:49.160
wouldn't be as good as you.

27:50.240 --> 27:50.960
Truly.

27:51.440 --> 27:52.800
See, I told you.

27:52.960 --> 27:54.920
This kind of small-town business

27:55.080 --> 27:56.320
isn't for just anyone.

27:56.320 --> 27:57.720
There's real know-how in it.

27:57.720 --> 27:59.240
Not everyone gets it.

27:59.680 --> 28:01.440
And today I bought seafood,

28:01.440 --> 28:02.880
plus Xuan Island's daily expenses,

28:02.880 --> 28:03.680
that all has to go through

28:04.960 --> 28:06.320
Xuan Island's accounts, right?

28:09.200 --> 28:09.960
No one's blaming you.

28:12.440 --> 28:13.480
We never really expected Xuan Island

28:13.480 --> 28:14.440
to make much money anyway.

28:14.960 --> 28:16.040
Didn't expect it to turn a profit at all.

28:16.680 --> 28:17.400
Well…

28:18.000 --> 28:19.760
my effort at Xuan Island

28:19.800 --> 28:21.200
wasn't for nothing.

28:22.400 --> 28:23.000
Ye,

28:23.800 --> 28:26.000
you're our family's lucky star.

28:26.400 --> 28:27.440
From now on just stay here

28:27.440 --> 28:28.160
and take it easy.

28:28.960 --> 28:29.640
I'll cook you

28:30.280 --> 28:31.320
something nice.

28:31.880 --> 28:32.320
Just wait.

28:44.200 --> 28:44.640
Hello?

28:46.560 --> 28:47.760
What's up over there in Hainan?

28:49.000 --> 28:50.280
I want two more jobs.

28:50.840 --> 28:51.280
[What now?]

28:51.760 --> 28:53.880
[Not just debt, you've got
a cousin to support too?]

28:55.760 --> 28:56.920
Quanya runs his mouth fast.

28:57.200 --> 28:57.960
[Of course.]

28:58.280 --> 28:59.560
[My brother keeps me updated]

28:59.560 --> 29:00.440
[on you.]

29:02.520 --> 29:03.400
[Wait for my call tonight.]

29:03.600 --> 29:04.040
Okay.

29:04.880 --> 29:05.400
Thanks.

29:10.200 --> 29:11.240
Can I come in?

29:12.960 --> 29:13.640
Hang on.

29:13.880 --> 29:14.440
I'll come out.

29:20.880 --> 29:22.000
What? Need me for something?

29:23.560 --> 29:26.680
I've got something to talk to you about.

29:28.480 --> 29:30.040
Actually, I was just about
to ask you something too.

29:30.520 --> 29:31.160
What is it?

29:31.480 --> 29:32.840
You've seen how Xuan Island is doing.

29:33.000 --> 29:33.720
Lanfang's heart

29:33.720 --> 29:34.840
isn't really in it.

29:35.000 --> 29:36.440
She even takes money out
to gamble sometimes.

29:37.160 --> 29:38.400
I hope you can help

29:38.760 --> 29:39.560
check the accounts

29:39.760 --> 29:40.800
at the end of every month.

29:43.240 --> 29:43.840
Perfect,

29:44.160 --> 29:45.560
I was going to say the same thing.

29:46.400 --> 29:47.400
But just keeping the books

29:47.640 --> 29:48.760
won't fix the root problem.

29:49.160 --> 29:50.080
Might as well solve it properly in one go.

29:52.320 --> 29:53.080
What do you mean?

29:55.600 --> 29:58.080
Food's up!

29:58.160 --> 29:59.840
Last dish,

29:59.840 --> 30:01.440
stir-fried squid!

30:03.160 --> 30:03.880
Not bad, right?

30:04.000 --> 30:05.080
All your favorites.

30:05.160 --> 30:06.440
Come, eat up!

30:06.560 --> 30:07.480
Let's dig in.

30:08.160 --> 30:08.960
Auntie, Grandma.

30:09.320 --> 30:10.400
I want to talk to you about something.

30:10.480 --> 30:10.880
Go ahead.

30:11.160 --> 30:12.680
I want to grow

30:12.680 --> 30:13.320
Xuan Island's business.

30:18.440 --> 30:19.600
You've already put money in.

30:19.880 --> 30:20.880
No need to waste time

30:20.880 --> 30:21.480
on this.

30:22.520 --> 30:24.040
I don't think it's a waste of time.

30:25.480 --> 30:26.760
My dream is

30:26.760 --> 30:27.920
to become rich anyway.

30:28.240 --> 30:29.400
So turning Xuan Island around

30:29.640 --> 30:30.840
is one small step

30:30.840 --> 30:31.520
toward that dream.

30:32.520 --> 30:33.160
Ye,

30:33.560 --> 30:35.760
I know you mean well.

30:36.240 --> 30:37.680
But business

30:37.680 --> 30:38.800
isn't like school.

30:39.720 --> 30:40.640
It's not that simple.

30:41.040 --> 30:41.640
Besides,

30:41.800 --> 30:43.400
you think I can't compete

30:43.400 --> 30:45.000
with those three other salons?

30:46.280 --> 30:47.280
No, Auntie.

30:47.280 --> 30:48.080
Just think of it as

30:48.080 --> 30:49.200
supporting my dream.

30:49.520 --> 30:50.480
I support you.

30:50.920 --> 30:51.800
Thanks, Grandma.

30:52.880 --> 30:54.360
Don't get too carried away.

30:54.640 --> 30:55.560
Who's getting carried away?

30:56.400 --> 30:58.280
I'm 100% serious.

30:59.760 --> 31:00.560
The hairtail can vouch for me.

31:01.600 --> 31:02.400
Let me finish

31:02.400 --> 31:03.160
a full plan first.

31:03.280 --> 31:03.920
Then you can decide

31:04.080 --> 31:05.080
whether to go for it.

31:06.480 --> 31:07.000
Alright.

31:07.280 --> 31:08.240
We'll see about it later.

31:09.680 --> 31:10.440
Low expectations

31:11.240 --> 31:13.160
often lead to pleasant surprises.

31:16.040 --> 31:16.680
Alright.

31:18.360 --> 31:19.280
Forget the "full plan",

31:19.280 --> 31:20.360
just eat more.

31:43.600 --> 31:44.120
Wu.

31:46.080 --> 31:47.200
Work piled up

31:47.520 --> 31:48.200
while you were gone.

31:50.160 --> 31:50.640
Give it to me.

31:51.600 --> 31:52.280
I'll fix it slowly.

32:01.240 --> 32:01.840
Liu Nian,

32:02.280 --> 32:03.320
I wanna ask you something.

32:03.360 --> 32:05.600
We mostly do short to medium hair,

32:05.600 --> 32:07.640
with perms and coloring
most common, right?

32:08.160 --> 32:08.760
That's right.

32:09.160 --> 32:10.720
The biggest spending

32:10.720 --> 32:12.440
comes from women over 35.

32:12.880 --> 32:13.800
If you and Auntie

32:13.800 --> 32:14.720
work together,

32:15.040 --> 32:16.640
how many can you handle in a day at most?

32:16.840 --> 32:17.680
Let me think.

32:18.320 --> 32:20.960
When business was good
a couple of years ago,

32:21.280 --> 32:22.320
around 15 or so.

32:46.000 --> 32:47.080
I don't believe it.

32:47.080 --> 32:47.720
Today I'm going to

32:47.720 --> 32:49.440
go all in and do something big!

32:52.040 --> 32:53.360
What are those two doing?

32:54.480 --> 32:55.840
Daydreaming about getting rich.

32:56.840 --> 32:57.360
Auntie.

32:57.880 --> 32:59.680
Looks pretty formal.

33:00.600 --> 33:02.040
Let's put in some effort too!

33:02.080 --> 33:02.760
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

33:05.520 --> 33:06.000
So, how is it?

33:06.720 --> 33:08.080
This plan is pretty detailed.

33:09.880 --> 33:10.960
But it's still just a plan.

33:11.600 --> 33:12.240
How do you actually make it work?

33:12.560 --> 33:13.800
Why wouldn't it work?

33:14.560 --> 33:15.800
I visited all those

33:15.800 --> 33:17.160
three barbershops.

33:17.880 --> 33:19.000
From what I saw, one called

33:19.000 --> 33:20.440
"Fashion Pioneer"

33:20.440 --> 33:21.680
is the busiest.

33:22.360 --> 33:23.360
I observed it.

33:23.440 --> 33:25.480
Its average daily customer flow is

33:25.520 --> 33:27.000
20 to 30 people.

33:27.080 --> 33:28.320
About the same as Xuan Island,

33:28.840 --> 33:29.600
with just two staff

33:29.640 --> 33:30.760
including the owner.

33:31.360 --> 33:33.080
Men's haircut is 15.

33:33.080 --> 33:34.280
Women's haircut is 25.

33:34.400 --> 33:35.600
Perms and coloring

33:35.600 --> 33:36.440
are around 150

33:36.440 --> 33:37.320
to 200.

33:37.680 --> 33:38.680
The pricing is definitely

33:38.720 --> 33:39.560
lower than Xuan Island's.

33:39.680 --> 33:41.040
And the customer base is also

33:41.080 --> 33:42.000
mostly regulars,

33:42.200 --> 33:43.480
and skewing older.

33:44.160 --> 33:44.680
Yeah.

33:44.920 --> 33:46.160
So compared to it, Xuan Island

33:46.480 --> 33:47.440
has no price advantage.

33:49.920 --> 33:51.480
Yeah, no advantage.

33:51.480 --> 33:52.800
No advantage

33:52.800 --> 33:53.720
in the customer base either.

33:54.000 --> 33:54.480
But,

33:54.680 --> 33:55.840
we can attract

33:55.840 --> 33:56.800
younger customers.

33:57.000 --> 33:58.200
But the kind of people
you're talking about

33:58.360 --> 33:59.440
don't usually get their hair done

33:59.440 --> 33:59.960
in Zhazhating.

34:00.240 --> 34:01.160
They'd rather go to the city

34:01.160 --> 34:01.800
or the county town.

34:03.840 --> 34:04.640
So,

34:05.360 --> 34:06.240
we need to make Xuan Island

34:06.600 --> 34:08.159
their first choice.

34:08.600 --> 34:09.639
Then we can increase revenue.

34:10.760 --> 34:11.239
How so?

34:13.400 --> 34:14.199
I've thought about it.

34:14.920 --> 34:16.159
I want to transform Xuan Island.

34:16.440 --> 34:17.360
If there's no demand,

34:17.639 --> 34:18.679
then create demand.

34:19.159 --> 34:20.280
We'll launch new hairstyles,

34:20.360 --> 34:21.400
use new techniques,

34:21.719 --> 34:22.719
and attract new customers.

34:23.000 --> 34:23.840
We'll increase our visibility.

34:24.080 --> 34:25.320
Shooting some stylized

34:25.320 --> 34:26.360
hairstyle promo photos.

34:26.679 --> 34:27.480
Handing out flyers,

34:27.679 --> 34:29.120
promoting the Xuan Island.

34:29.800 --> 34:30.880
Then we'll get our customers
to buy memberships

34:30.920 --> 34:32.239
and retain them.

34:32.639 --> 34:33.600
What era do you think this is?

34:33.760 --> 34:34.639
Still handing out flyers?

34:35.760 --> 34:37.239
Yeah, everyone's on their phones now.

34:37.520 --> 34:38.320
But we know Zhazhating

34:38.320 --> 34:39.719
is a close-knit community.

34:39.920 --> 34:40.760
So handing out flyers

34:40.760 --> 34:42.159
is the most direct and effective way

34:42.159 --> 34:43.000
to get new customers.

34:43.280 --> 34:45.159
The flyer is the key.

34:45.440 --> 34:46.400
It has to be precise,

34:46.560 --> 34:48.639
polished, and eye-catching.

34:52.040 --> 34:52.880
I was just thinking,

34:53.000 --> 34:54.760
what if Xuan Island's business

34:55.239 --> 34:56.280
really takes off?

34:56.880 --> 34:57.680
Then you wouldn't have

34:57.680 --> 34:58.640
to work yourself so hard

34:58.840 --> 35:00.080
and juggle extra jobs because of me.

35:05.920 --> 35:07.600
But you're

35:07.600 --> 35:08.960
only part of the reason.

35:10.440 --> 35:11.760
Didn't you say before

35:12.520 --> 35:13.680
you treat me like family?

35:14.240 --> 35:15.800
I wanna treat this place like home too,

35:16.160 --> 35:17.440
and help take some of the load off.

35:19.000 --> 35:19.760
Just

35:21.080 --> 35:22.440
trust me with Xuan Island.

35:22.600 --> 35:23.320
I've got this.

35:28.880 --> 35:29.720
Why are you looking at me?

35:31.400 --> 35:32.440
Decided yet?

35:33.000 --> 35:33.880
Going for it or not?

35:37.320 --> 35:38.080
Then let's try it.

35:38.680 --> 35:39.440
No pressure on the outcome.

35:41.160 --> 35:41.560
Yes!

35:47.320 --> 35:48.400
These all look great.

35:48.600 --> 35:50.160
I downloaded all these

35:50.480 --> 35:51.720
from a Beijing stylist's

35:51.720 --> 35:52.560
Moments.

35:52.800 --> 35:53.320
Not bad, right?

35:53.560 --> 35:54.120
Yeah, pretty good.

35:55.040 --> 35:56.480
This hair must be tough to do.

36:04.240 --> 36:06.840
The coffee you make is the best.

36:07.080 --> 36:08.440
Try my pastries too.

36:09.040 --> 36:10.040
You made these yourself?

36:10.040 --> 36:10.960
Yeah.

36:10.960 --> 36:11.880
- What is it?
- Try it.

36:12.160 --> 36:13.320
Mung bean cake?

36:13.400 --> 36:14.440
Yeah, give it a try.

37:20.920 --> 37:22.440
That girl Ye

37:22.680 --> 37:23.880
is really something.

37:24.400 --> 37:25.960
She came here just to stay over,

37:25.960 --> 37:27.800
and ended up running the place.

37:28.160 --> 37:29.680
Know what note she left me?

37:29.920 --> 37:33.280
"Skipping mahjong makes you
twice as charming!"

37:34.160 --> 37:35.280
And a couple of days ago

37:35.920 --> 37:37.480
she wrote:

37:37.640 --> 37:39.560
"Auntie, you're the best barbershop lady"

37:39.640 --> 37:41.040
"in the world!"

37:41.360 --> 37:42.520
What do you call this?

37:42.520 --> 37:43.960
Kids these days really get it.

37:44.160 --> 37:46.160
It's "carrot and stick."

37:46.760 --> 37:47.800
That little girl

37:47.800 --> 37:48.960
really has skills.

37:49.360 --> 37:51.000
Her bookkeeping notebook

37:51.800 --> 37:52.680
is really useful.

37:52.720 --> 37:53.240
Really?

37:53.400 --> 37:54.600
Our Big G's been

37:54.600 --> 37:55.480
using it too.

37:55.760 --> 37:56.920
It's actually pretty convenient.

37:57.360 --> 37:58.560
Maybe she can

37:58.600 --> 37:59.600
really help turn

37:59.600 --> 38:00.240
Xuan Island around.

38:01.040 --> 38:03.160
A bunch of kids like that?

38:03.360 --> 38:04.640
I don't buy it.

38:04.880 --> 38:06.040
Not necessarily.

38:06.160 --> 38:06.840
Don't forget,

38:07.000 --> 38:07.520
you only trained

38:07.520 --> 38:08.680
for two months

38:08.760 --> 38:09.800
before opening Xuan Island.

38:10.040 --> 38:11.360
And me,

38:11.360 --> 38:12.880
I inherited my mom's
mahjong parlor young too.

38:13.320 --> 38:14.760
And you, Cici,

38:14.920 --> 38:16.000
you started dating

38:16.160 --> 38:17.960
Big G's dad right after high school!

38:18.240 --> 38:19.880
What are you two talking about?

38:19.880 --> 38:21.360
I was already 18 or 19, okay?

38:21.360 --> 38:22.080
so what's wrong

38:22.080 --> 38:22.600
with dating?

38:22.720 --> 38:24.000
We were so young back then, weren't we?

38:24.000 --> 38:24.760
Truly.

38:24.760 --> 38:25.840
- Exactly.
- Our youth.

38:25.840 --> 38:26.960
Our kids are already 18 or 19 now.

38:27.640 --> 38:29.720
Where did our youth go?

38:35.320 --> 38:36.600
♪My youth has gone♪

38:36.600 --> 38:38.360
♪like a bird in flight♪

38:41.760 --> 38:42.960
♪My youth has gone♪

38:42.960 --> 38:45.200
♪like a bird in flight♪

38:45.960 --> 38:47.600
Who hasn't been young?

38:49.320 --> 38:50.760
Let's play mahjong!

38:51.080 --> 38:51.920
One round.

38:52.160 --> 38:53.440
One round only.

38:54.360 --> 38:55.720
That's not like you.

39:01.880 --> 39:02.360
Wu.

39:04.200 --> 39:05.320
I've finished revising the plan.

39:05.320 --> 39:06.080
Do you still wanna take a look?

39:06.640 --> 39:07.080
No need.

39:07.400 --> 39:08.920
Then we'll execute it tomorrow
according to the plan.

39:09.360 --> 39:09.760
Fine.

39:10.760 --> 39:12.200
But we don't have any models.

39:12.880 --> 39:13.720
Of course we have!

39:13.800 --> 39:14.600
We've got ready ones!

39:14.840 --> 39:15.320
Who?

39:20.760 --> 39:21.480
You sure?

39:22.840 --> 39:23.320
Don't believe it?

39:24.440 --> 39:25.400
Bet me if you don't.

39:26.440 --> 39:26.920
Fine.

39:27.240 --> 39:27.720
Deal.

39:28.040 --> 39:28.600
North Wind.

39:28.800 --> 39:29.480
Me?

39:29.760 --> 39:30.480
Us?

39:30.680 --> 39:31.520
Models?

39:35.720 --> 39:36.920
Ye,

39:37.200 --> 39:39.200
you're flattering us too much.

39:39.680 --> 39:40.600
Let me tell you,

39:40.600 --> 39:41.640
when I was young,

39:41.640 --> 39:42.480
I might've had

39:42.480 --> 39:43.760
a bit of looks.

39:44.040 --> 39:45.360
But at our age now,

39:45.360 --> 39:46.520
you want us to go on stage

39:46.520 --> 39:47.640
and pose around like that?

39:47.680 --> 39:48.840
That's way too embarrassing.

39:49.080 --> 39:50.160
Exactly, Ye.

39:50.360 --> 39:51.560
At our age,

39:51.720 --> 39:53.400
we're basically almost grandmothers.

39:53.560 --> 39:54.440
People would

39:54.680 --> 39:55.880
laugh at us!

39:55.880 --> 39:57.200
I wouldn't laugh,

39:57.240 --> 39:57.720
I'd love it.

39:57.760 --> 39:58.720
What does it have to do with you?

39:59.000 --> 39:59.920
Stop interrupting

39:59.920 --> 40:00.800
women's talk.

40:01.240 --> 40:02.040
You're talking

40:02.040 --> 40:03.280
about runway

40:03.280 --> 40:04.400
models.

40:04.720 --> 40:05.640
I'm talking

40:05.640 --> 40:06.920
about photo models.

40:07.560 --> 40:09.560
Either "runway" or "photo",

40:09.640 --> 40:10.480
those are

40:10.480 --> 40:12.200
for young girls.

40:12.920 --> 40:14.600
We're all mothers now.

40:14.600 --> 40:15.840
It's too embarrassing.

40:15.920 --> 40:17.720
No, not at all!

40:17.840 --> 40:18.680
Every age

40:18.680 --> 40:20.200
has its own beauty.

40:20.800 --> 40:21.440
Ye,

40:21.560 --> 40:23.080
what do you need models for anyway?

40:24.480 --> 40:25.960
For Xuan Island's promo photos.

40:26.200 --> 40:26.680
Look,

40:27.600 --> 40:29.240
these are my flyers.

40:29.480 --> 40:31.520
I wanna put real photos

40:31.520 --> 40:32.520
in these

40:32.680 --> 40:33.960
blank spaces here.

40:34.360 --> 40:35.440
Real photos?

40:35.680 --> 40:37.080
Then how are you planning to promote this?

40:38.400 --> 40:39.480
Think about it, Auntie.

40:39.840 --> 40:40.920
If we want Xuan Island

40:41.480 --> 40:42.560
to do well,

40:42.880 --> 40:43.800
we need to expand

40:44.040 --> 40:45.160
our customer base, right?

40:45.360 --> 40:46.360
So how to expand our customer base?

40:46.520 --> 40:47.960
We need higher visibility.

40:48.160 --> 40:49.640
And to raise visibility,

40:49.880 --> 40:52.600
we need strong promotion.

40:52.760 --> 40:53.200
You know,

40:53.520 --> 40:55.240
our main customers

40:55.440 --> 40:56.280
are women

40:56.280 --> 40:57.320
aged 35 to 55.

40:57.800 --> 40:59.920
That's exactly your age group.

41:01.680 --> 41:02.480
Sorry, Ye,

41:02.480 --> 41:04.640
all this talk about promotion

41:04.640 --> 41:05.200
and customer base,

41:05.200 --> 41:06.800
we don't really get it.

41:06.960 --> 41:07.680
Yeah.

41:07.680 --> 41:09.160
Do we even need promotion?

41:09.200 --> 41:10.080
Everyone already knows

41:10.080 --> 41:11.200
Lanfang's skills.

41:11.480 --> 41:12.200
Her perms

41:12.200 --> 41:13.160
last half a year without falling apart.

41:13.320 --> 41:14.200
Exactly.

41:14.440 --> 41:15.160
Exactly!

41:15.320 --> 41:16.400
Strong technique

41:16.480 --> 41:18.000
is our core advantage,

41:18.280 --> 41:19.720
we've got to let people know about it!

41:20.040 --> 41:21.200
So you three

41:21.400 --> 41:23.160
will be Xuan Island's ambassadors.

41:23.520 --> 41:25.640
Show your beautiful selves.

41:26.000 --> 41:27.160
Once people see how good you look,

41:27.320 --> 41:28.400
more customers

41:28.400 --> 41:29.320
will naturally come.

41:30.840 --> 41:32.600
That's just celebrity marketing, isn't it?

41:32.880 --> 41:33.880
Your niece

41:33.880 --> 41:36.000
is basically making you all stars.

41:36.920 --> 41:38.440
Exactly, stars!

41:38.840 --> 41:39.920
Your titles:

41:40.280 --> 41:41.960
"Zhazhating Three Beauties",

41:42.040 --> 41:43.400
global ambassadors of Xuan Island!

41:44.160 --> 41:45.280
Global?

41:45.440 --> 41:46.680
Then we're

41:47.040 --> 41:49.920
Xuan Island's ambassadors in Zhazhating?

41:49.960 --> 41:50.400
Exactly!

41:51.840 --> 41:52.480
To put it simply,

41:52.560 --> 41:53.480
it's just free photo shoots

41:53.480 --> 41:54.760
for the three of you.

41:54.800 --> 41:55.600
Got it?

41:56.400 --> 41:56.960
One-yak.

41:57.280 --> 41:59.560
- I win!
- I win!
- I win too!

42:00.600 --> 42:02.800
We're about to blow up!

42:02.880 --> 42:03.320
Alright!

42:03.520 --> 42:05.000
It's settled then!

42:05.160 --> 42:05.640
We three should

42:05.640 --> 42:06.960
really get ourselves dolled up!

42:08.400 --> 42:09.640
Honestly,

42:10.040 --> 42:11.360
back in my younger days,

42:11.600 --> 42:13.280
a talent scout even approached me.

42:14.720 --> 42:16.320
Here you go again!

42:29.480 --> 42:30.080
You won.

42:30.880 --> 42:31.880
"Zhazha drink" plus.

42:34.280 --> 42:35.480
Told you so.

42:36.080 --> 42:37.560
I could definitely convince them.

42:38.000 --> 42:38.680
Should've

42:38.800 --> 42:40.000
made a bigger bet with you.

42:41.120 --> 42:42.720
Actually, using stock photos
would be easier.

42:44.640 --> 42:45.600
Yeah, it would.

42:46.160 --> 42:46.880
But it doesn't

42:47.520 --> 42:48.880
suit Zhazhating.

42:49.680 --> 42:50.240
Think about it.

42:50.720 --> 42:51.800
In big cities,

42:52.040 --> 42:53.560
you can just download a few photos

42:53.800 --> 42:54.400
to bluff people.

42:54.440 --> 42:55.680
Anyway, nobody knows anyone.

42:55.880 --> 42:56.840
But like you said,

42:57.000 --> 42:58.640
Zhazhating is a close-knit community.

42:59.200 --> 42:59.960
So Xuan Island is

43:00.080 --> 43:01.480
relying on regular customers.

43:02.840 --> 43:03.480
True.

43:04.080 --> 43:04.960
In Zhazhating,

43:04.960 --> 43:06.200
everyone knows everyone.

43:06.400 --> 43:07.360
Most customers

43:07.640 --> 43:08.520
are regulars anyway.

43:08.600 --> 43:09.200
Yeah.

43:09.880 --> 43:10.560
And I believe

43:11.240 --> 43:12.960
Auntie Yufen and Auntie Shanxi

43:13.000 --> 43:14.080
were probably both real beauties

43:14.240 --> 43:15.800
when they were young, just like Auntie.

43:17.320 --> 43:18.480
You've got a sharp eye.

43:19.480 --> 43:21.040
They're usually busy with work

43:21.320 --> 43:22.480
and don't have time to dress up.

43:22.840 --> 43:24.240
If we style them properly,

43:24.640 --> 43:25.960
the transformation will be huge.

43:26.240 --> 43:26.880
Then,

43:27.120 --> 43:29.320
we take "before" photos

43:29.760 --> 43:31.080
and "after" photos

43:31.320 --> 43:32.480
and compare them side by side.

43:33.960 --> 43:35.320
Instant impact.

43:35.600 --> 43:36.520
And maximum advertising effect.

43:37.400 --> 43:38.640
The slogan will be:

43:38.920 --> 43:40.960
"Director Li works her magic,

43:41.200 --> 43:43.240
middle-aged women in Zhazhating shine again".
